      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto:",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Al-Shaykh Ab\u016b\u02bel-Fa\u1e0dl al-Parn\u0101s b. R. Aaron ha-Levi, of blessed memory, rented from al-Shaykh&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ab\u016b\u02bel-Bay\u0101n al-J\u0101b\u012b b. Elazar ha-Levi, of blessed memory, the \u1e6dabaqa that is in Tuj\u012bb, in D\u0101r&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>al-Zajj\u0101j, in the Silsila lane,which is the apartment of Mak\u0101rim (and) b. Sahl\u0101n. This he rented for 5&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>dir. a month for a period of six full and consecutive months,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>(5-6) beginning Monday, 23 of the month of Elul 1491. A complete and solemn acquisition was executed, from each of the two (parties), with an instrument that is proper&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>to acquire with, with the formula \"from now on\".</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
